]>\r\n<style type=\"text/css\">\r\n.b, .s  {font-family: Arial, Helvetica, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;}\r\n.v {font-family: Georgia, Palatino Linotype, serif !important;}\r\n.t {padding-bottom: 10px !important;}\r\na {color: #222222; text-decoration:underline !important;}\r\n</style>\r\n<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if gte mso 7]>\r\n<xml>\r\n<o:OfficeDocumentSettings>\r\n<o:AllowPNG/>\r\n<o:PixelsPerInch>96</o:PixelsPerInch>\r\n</o:OfficeDocumentSettings>\r\n</xml>\r\n<![endif]-->\r\n</head>\r\n<body style=\"background-color:#f5f5f5;margin:0 auto;padding:0;text-align:center\" class=\"a\">\r\n<div style=\"display:none;font-size:1px;color:#222;line-height:1px;max-height:0;max-width:0;opacity:0;overflow:hidden\"> 🦬 Plus: Vista du jour | Wednesday, October 07, 2026</div>\r\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"background-color:#f6f6f6;text-align:center\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"max-width:600px\">\r\n<!--[if mso]>\r\n<table style=\"width:600px;\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<![endif]-->\r\n<table style=\"max-width:600px;width:100%;margin:0 auto;text-align:left;background:#fff\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td height=\"20\" style=\"height:20px;font-size:0\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top\">\r\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left:3.5%\">\r\n<a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47828277.283211/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuYXhpb3MuY29tP3V0bV9zb3VyY2U9bmV3c2xldHRlciZ1dG1fbWVkaXVtPWVtYWlsJnV0bV9jYW1wYWlnbj1uZXdzbGV0dGVyX2F4aW9zZmluaXNobGluZSZzdHJlYW09dG9w/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aB04688f6e\" title=\"AXIOS\" target=\"_blank\"> <img src=\"https://static.axios.com/img-email/axios-retina.png\" alt=\"Axios\" width=\"83\" border=\"0\"/> </a> <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47828277.283211/aHR0cDovL3d3dy5heGlvcy5jb20_dXRtX3NvdXJjZT1uZXdzbGV0dGVyJnV0bV9tZWRpdW09ZW1haWwmdXRtX2NhbXBhaWduPW5ld3NsZXR0ZXJfYXhpb3NmaW5pc2hsaW5lJnN0cmVhbT10b3A/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aB779a3458\"><img src=\"https://link.axios.com/img/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94ash4j9.62iz/41cfd872.gif\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\" /></a></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-right:3.5%\" align=\"right\"> <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47828277.283211/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuYXhpb3MuY29tL25ld3NsZXR0ZXJzL2F4aW9zLWZpbmlzaC1saW5lLTlhYmRmMWFmLTJkZGQtNDAyYy1hZDgxLWIwNDA3NjhmMDBhZC5odG1sP3V0bV9zb3VyY2U9bmV3c2xldHRlciZ1dG1fbWVkaXVtPWVtYWlsJnV0bV9jYW1wYWlnbj1uZXdzbGV0dGVyX2F4aW9zZmluaXNobGluZSZzdHJlYW09dG9w/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aB1263acf6\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"b\" style=\"color:#222;font-size:13px;font-family:'gordita',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;text-decoration:underline\">View in browser</a> </td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td height=\"30\" style=\"height:30px;font-size:0\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>  <tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align:center;line-height:1.3\"> </td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td height=\"16\" style=\"height:16px;font-size:0\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr><tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align:center;line-height:1\">\r\n<span class=\"s\" style=\"font-size:44px;font-family:'gorditamedium',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#008dc8;letter-spacing:-1px;line-height:1\"> Axios Finish Line </span>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align:center;line-height:1.5;padding-bottom:35px;padding-top:10px\">\r\n<span class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:13px;color:#222;font-family:'gorditamedium',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">By  Mike Allen and Erica Pandey and Jim VandeHei  <span style=\"margin:0 6px\">&middot;</span> Oct 07, 2026 </span>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr><tr>\r\n<td class=\"v\" style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:Georgia,serif;line-height:1.75;color:#222;letter-spacing:-0.1px;padding:0 3.5%\"><p><strong>Welcome back! </strong><em>Smart Brevity™ count: 381 words … 1½ mins. Copy edited by Amy Stern.</em></p></td>\r\n</tr><tr>\r\n<td height=\"10\" style=\"height:10px;font-size:0;border-bottom:10px solid #f5f5f5\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>      <tr>\r\n<td height=\"10\" style=\"height:10px;font-size:0\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr><tr>\r\n<td style=\"padding:20px 3.5% 10px;line-height:1.5\">\r\n<span class=\"b k\" style=\"font-size:27px;font-family:'gorditamedium',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#222;letter-spacing:-0.1px;line-height:1.5\">  1 big thing: How goodness spreads </span>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>   <tr>\r\n<td height=\"10\" style=\"height:10px;font-size:0\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td> <img src=\"https://images.axios.com/RpMdJaI9SjfZ8ERwR2di0lY4RcI=/0x0:1920x1080/1920x1080/2026/04/23/1776958717542.jpeg\" width=\"600\" style=\"width:100%\" id=\"item02\" alt=\"Illustration of a crowd of people with certain highlighted people radiating kindness in the form of color shifts. \"> </td>\r\n</tr><tr>\r\n<td height=\"10\" style=\"height:10px;font-size:0\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"padding:0 3.5%;line-height:1.3\">\r\n<span class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:13px;color:#848484\"> <p>Illustration: Aïda Amer/Axios. Stock: Getty Images</p> </span>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr><tr>\r\n<td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15px;font-size:0\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr> <tr>\r\n<td class=\"v\" style=\"padding:0 3.5%;line-height:1.75;font-size:17px;font-family:Georgia,serif;color:#222;letter-spacing:-0.1px\"><p><strong>A wealth of psychology</strong> and behavioral research lets us track the life cycle of a good deed.</p><ul><li><strong>Why it matters: </strong>An act of kindness can benefit the person who does it, the person who receives it, and even people who witness it or hear about it.</li></ul><p><strong>How it works:</strong></p><ol><li><strong>🙋 The doer: </strong>Volunteering and performing other acts of kindness — from donating blood to smiling at a stranger on the street — benefits the doer, according to an <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47828277.283211/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuYXBhLm9yZy9tb25pdG9yLzIwMjYvMDctMDgvdm9sdW50ZWVyaW5nLWtpbmQtYWN0cz91dG1fc291cmNlPW5ld3NsZXR0ZXImdXRtX21lZGl1bT1lbWFpbCZ1dG1fY2FtcGFpZ249bmV3c2xldHRlcl9heGlvc2ZpbmlzaGxpbmUmc3RyZWFtPXRvcA/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aB267b54e6\" target=\"_blank\">American Psychological Association review</a> of several research papers. The perks include feeling happier and less lonely, anxious and depressed.</li><li><strong>💛 The receiver: </strong>As we've reported, <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47828277.283211/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuYXhpb3MuY29tLzIwMjIvMDkvMDgvcG93ZXItb2Ytc21hbGwtcmFuZG9tLWFjdHMtb2Yta2luZGVzcy1zdHVkeT91dG1fc291cmNlPW5ld3NsZXR0ZXImdXRtX21lZGl1bT1lbWFpbCZ1dG1fY2FtcGFpZ249bmV3c2xldHRlcl9heGlvc2ZpbmlzaGxpbmUmc3RyZWFtPXRvcA/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aB298061d0\" target=\"_blank\">we tend to underestimate</a> how much a simple gesture, like holding a door, means to the person on the receiving end. Plus, kindness can set off a chain reaction. People who benefit from a good deed are likelier to direct kindness to strangers themselves, <em>Axios' Ashley May </em><a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47828277.283211/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuYXhpb3MuY29tLzIwMjYvMDUvMDcva2luZG5lc3Mtc3VydmV5LWdhbGx1cD91dG1fc291cmNlPW5ld3NsZXR0ZXImdXRtX21lZGl1bT1lbWFpbCZ1dG1fY2FtcGFpZ249bmV3c2xldHRlcl9heGlvc2ZpbmlzaGxpbmUmc3RyZWFtPXRvcA/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aBf888cd50\" target=\"_blank\"><em>reports</em></a><em>.</em></li><li><strong>👀 The witness: </strong>Just watching someone do something nice helps, in a phenomenon researchers call \"<a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47828277.283211/aHR0cHM6Ly9wdWJtZWQubmNiaS5ubG0ubmloLmdvdi8yMDQyNDA2Mi8_dXRtX3NvdXJjZT1uZXdzbGV0dGVyJnV0bV9tZWRpdW09ZW1haWwmdXRtX2NhbXBhaWduPW5ld3NsZXR0ZXJfYXhpb3NmaW5pc2hsaW5lJnN0cmVhbT10b3A/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aBb4d79725\" target=\"_blank\">moral elevation</a>.\" The boost people get from witnessing kindness also makes them likelier to spread it.</li></ol><p>📰 <strong>Even <em>reading</em> about</strong> good deeds has an effect: In <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47828277.283211/aHR0cHM6Ly9qb3VybmFscy5wbG9zLm9yZy9wbG9zb25lL2FydGljbGU_aWQ9MTAuMTM3MS9qb3VybmFsLnBvbmUuMDI4NDQzOCZ1dG1fc291cmNlPW5ld3NsZXR0ZXImdXRtX21lZGl1bT1lbWFpbCZ1dG1fY2FtcGFpZ249bmV3c2xldHRlcl9heGlvc2ZpbmlzaGxpbmUmc3RyZWFtPXRvcA/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aBffe141ba\" target=\"_blank\">a 2023 study</a> published in the journal <em>PLOS ONE</em>, people who read news stories about good deeds after reading negative news stories felt uplifted and more inclined to believe in the goodness of others.</p><p><strong>What's next: </strong>We want to spread the goodness by reviving one of our <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47828277.283211/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuYXhpb3MuY29tLzIwMjIvMDkvMTMvZmluaXNoLWxpbmUtcGF5LWl0LWZvcndhcmQtc21hbGwtcmFuZG9tLWFjdHMtb2Yta2luZG5lc3M_dXRtX3NvdXJjZT1uZXdzbGV0dGVyJnV0bV9tZWRpdW09ZW1haWwmdXRtX2NhbXBhaWduPW5ld3NsZXR0ZXJfYXhpb3NmaW5pc2hsaW5lJnN0cmVhbT10b3A/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aBf51771ee\" target=\"_blank\">favorite</a> <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47828277.283211/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuYXhpb3MuY29tLzIwMjIvMDkvMjcvYXhpb3MtZmluaXNoLWxpbmUtc3ByZWFkaW5nLXJhbmRvbS1hY3RzLW9mLWtpbmRuZXNzP3V0bV9zb3VyY2U9bmV3c2xldHRlciZ1dG1fbWVkaXVtPWVtYWlsJnV0bV9jYW1wYWlnbj1uZXdzbGV0dGVyX2F4aW9zZmluaXNobGluZSZzdHJlYW09dG9w/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aB0ce9c01a\" target=\"_blank\">Finish Line</a> <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47828277.283211/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuYXhpb3MuY29tLzIwMjIvMTEvMTUvYXhpb3MtZmluaXNoLWxpbmUta2luZG5lc3MtYWJvdW5kcz91dG1fc291cmNlPW5ld3NsZXR0ZXImdXRtX21lZGl1bT1lbWFpbCZ1dG1fY2FtcGFpZ249bmV3c2xldHRlcl9heGlvc2ZpbmlzaGxpbmUmc3RyZWFtPXRvcA/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aB7843a0b2\" target=\"_blank\">series</a> — sharing the good deeds you encounter with fellow readers.</p><ul><li><strong>Tell us about </strong>a random act of kindness you received or witnessed — from a friend, a family member, a neighbor or a total stranger — in 2-3 sentences. Send it to finishline@axios.com, along with your name and hometown, and we'll feature the stories in future editions.</li></ul></td>\r\n</tr> <tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 3.5% 25px\">   <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47828277.283211/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuZm